      "message": "[error] Line 2960: 🔴 The stale-snapshot guard at line 2919 still compares only `created` and `removed` before this erasure update. Devices upgraded from the previous implementation may already have `conv-\u003einfo.removed` persisted as the local receipt time; when they later receive the originating snapshot (`removed\u003dR`, `erased\u003dE`), `R \u003c local receipt` causes the entire snapshot to be skipped, so this newer `erased` timestamp is never applied and the repository remains on disk. Compare lifecycle/erasure timestamps independently while still rejecting snapshots from older `created` generations, or migrate the legacy receipt-time value.",
